WEBVTT

00:09:29.756 --> 00:09:33.156
Every time that I was choosing
randomly in a city,

00:09:33.196 --> 00:09:37.556
what I was doing
was making an inquiry, asking,

00:09:37.596 --> 00:09:41.076
"Mumbai, tell me what you're about."

00:09:41.076 --> 00:09:44.676
And then the answer would tell me
something about the structure of that city

00:09:44.716 --> 00:09:45.916
and my relationship to it

00:09:45.916 --> 00:09:48.916
and its relationship
with the rest of the world.

00:09:50.436 --> 00:09:51.796
And so I ...

00:09:53.436 --> 00:09:57.276
I had, like, a really tidy ending
for this previously.

00:09:58.036 --> 00:10:01.276
And as I was coming up here,
I decided to scrap it, because ...